  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->
   "paclet:SpinWeightedSpheroidalHarmonics/ref/\
SpinSpinWeightedSpheroidalHarmonicS"],
 " without specifying values for \[Theta] and \[Phi]."
}], "Notes",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.893751587620846*^9, 3.89375159165171*^9}, {
  3.894444319106576*^9, 3.894444329367959*^9}},
